# Cash payment restriction (AUR-13)

## Must

- Server enforces cash limits in `CashPaymentRestrictionGuard` on grocery checkout when `cashAmount > 0` (CASH / MIXED).
- Absolute cash ban categories via product attr `cashRestrictionCategory`: ELECTRICITY, NATURAL_GAS, WATER_SUPPLY, GOVERNMENT_SERVICES, ALCOHOL, TOBACCO, FUEL, EV_CHARGING, REAL_ESTATE.
- VEHICLE_MNOG: ban cash if age &lt; 10 years (`vehicleManufactureYear`).
- AGRICULTURAL / `agriculturalProduct=true`: cash allowed (skips amount limit when entire cart is agri).
- BRV from `GET /operator/brv`; limit = `brvAmount × cashLimitBrvUnits` (default 340000×74 ≈ 25.16M UZS).
- API errors include `context.reasonCode` for the frontend.

## Must NOT

- Bypass the guard for online checkout with cash.
- Soften category bans without an explicit product-rule change.
